	/// HIDDEN — F0006.MCRP03 is empty on ODS (BUILD.md round-2 probe); Cognos's Business Group prompt fed from the legacy DW org hierarchy, which has no populated JDE counterpart. Kept in fetch for a future mapping.
	column 'Business Group'
		dataType: string
